{"url": "（本地文件）002、第二节：运用核心名词，精准指认具体对象.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\002、第二节：运用核心名词，精准指认具体对象.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 10.62, "text": "欢迎来到30天训练营的第二节课。", "end": 14.3}, {"start": 14.3, "text": "欢迎来到我们30天的训练营的第二节课。", "end": 18.82}, {"start": 19.26, "text": "现在记住,我们要避免笔记本流,不要过多的去依赖抄写。", "end": 28.37}, {"start": 28.37, "text": "不要去死气硬背,放松心情,泡一杯花茶,好好享受这个过程。", "end": 34.33}, {"start": 34.57, "text": "你只要能认真去听这30分钟,跟着我一起去做习题,", "end": 39.85}, {"start": 40.09, "text": "操练情境,你就上到了。", "end": 42.89}, {"start": 42.89, "text": "别忘了,可理解的输入,有目的的运用。", "end": 46.89}, {"start": 48.89, "text": "今天我们要在上节课的基础上,去指认事物,除了表达自己是谁。", "end": 55.41}, {"start": 55.41, "text": "I, you, he, her, they,这些代词以外,我们还要能清楚的指出他们在哪里。", "end": 62.69}, {"start": 62.69, "text": "Here, there,以及接下来我们要讲的指认。", "end": 66.89}, {"start": 66.93, "text": "如果teacher Eric问你们,what is this?", "end": 70.46}, {"start": 70.46, "text": "你要怎么回答?", "end": 72.06}, {"start": 72.06, "text": "This is a man,我们上节课有提到过男人man,this is a man。", "end": 80.71}, {"start": 80.71, "text": "What is this?", "end": 81.99}, {"start": 81.99, "text": "他是女人。", "end": 82.99}, {"start": 82.99, "text": "She is a woman,this is a woman。", "end": 89.38}, {"start": 89.38, "text": "注意下面有画圈,我们就认为离自己很近,在范围内,所以叫this is a woman。", "end": 97.62}, {"start": 97.66, "text": "万一圈圈在他处呢?", "end": 99.66}, {"start": 99.66, "text": "不在我们这里呢?", "end": 101.06}, {"start": 101.06, "text": "That is a man,this is a man。", "end": 111.15}, {"start": 111.15, "text": "This, that, this, that。", "end": 117.86}, {"start": 118.94, "text": "好,那这里呢?", "end": 120.94}, {"start": 120.94, "text": "如果他处是一个女人呢?", "end": 122.94}, {"start": 122.94, "text": "That is a woman,this is a man。", "end": 126.74}, {"start": 126.74, "text": "That, this, that。", "end": 130.54}, {"start": 130.54, "text": "这就是指认事物里最基础的两个词。", "end": 134.14}, {"start": 134.18, "text": "这个,那个。", "end": 135.98}, {"start": 135.98, "text": "This is a man,that is a woman。", "end": 138.78}, {"start": 138.78, "text": "This man, this man is here。", "end": 155.1}, {"start": 155.1, "text": "That man, that man is there。", "end": 166.27}, {"start": 166.27, "text": "如果你们在坐的是女生。", "end": 169.2}, {"start": 169.2, "text": "That woman is there。", "end": 176.02}, {"start": 176.02, "text": "如果你们是男人。", "end": 177.54}, {"start": 177.54, "text": "That man is there。", "end": 182.63}, {"start": 182.63, "text": "我们结合起来了,here, there跟this, that。", "end": 185.43}, {"start": 185.43, "text": "女生在范围内。", "end": 187.11}, {"start": 187.11, "text": "This woman, this woman is here。", "end": 194.22}, {"start": 194.22, "text": "女人到范围外了,是那个女人了。", "end": 196.94}, {"start": 196.94, "text": "That woman is there。", "end": 202.6}, {"start": 202.6, "text": "都听懂了吧?", "end": 203.6}, {"start": 203.6, "text": "你们现在在讲的已经是复杂的英语句子了。", "end": 208.06}, {"start": 208.06, "text": "不要小看啦。", "end": 209.06}, {"start": 209.06, "text": "那在梳理完男女人以后。", "end": 211.46}, {"start": 211.46, "text": "记住男女人也包含boy, girl。", "end": 214.06}, {"start": 214.06, "text": "小男孩小女孩也适用于刚刚的句式。", "end": 217.62}, {"start": 217.62, "text": "那万一是一个物体呢?", "end": 219.18}, {"start": 219.18, "text": "不男不女呢?", "end": 220.58}, {"start": 220.58, "text": "那我们就会说什么?", "end": 221.86}, {"start": 222.65, "text": "It is here, it is here。", "end": 230.88}, {"start": 230.96, "text": "It is here,那相应的。", "end": 233.76}, {"start": 233.76, "text": "如果物体在那里。", "end": 235.08}, {"start": 235.08, "text": "It is there。", "end": 237.88}, {"start": 237.88, "text": "好,接下来随着我们深化。", "end": 240.36}, {"start": 240.36, "text": "我们会拾起很多的新单词。", "end": 242.88}, {"start": 242.88, "text": "我希望你们自然的输入,不要焦虑,不要去背诵。", "end": 247.08}, {"start": 247.08, "text": "听一次算一次,听三次记住,听五次运用。", "end": 252.06}, {"start": 252.06, "text": "这辈子就不会忘了。", "end": 253.46}, {"start": 253.46, "text": "This is a hat, this is a hat。", "end": 256.66}, {"start": 256.66, "text": "我居然有这个东西。", "end": 257.94}, {"start": 257.94, "text": "This is a hat, this is a hat。", "end": 260.54}, {"start": 260.54, "text": "It is a hat, it is a hat。", "end": 266.19}, {"start": 266.19, "text": "This is a hat, that is a hat.", "end": 269.19}, {"start": 269.19, "text": "This is my hand, it is my hand.", "end": 274.42}, {"start": 274.42, "text": "It is my hand, this is the thumb.", "end": 279.56}, {"start": 279.56, "text": "These are the fingers, this is a thumb.", "end": 283.44}, {"start": 283.44, "text": "These are the fingers.", "end": 286.44}, {"start": 286.44, "text": "这里多出一个词,就是如果这里有好几个,我们就说these。", "end": 293.94}, {"start": 294.02, "text": "如果只有一个,就是this,好几个,these。", "end": 298.62}, {"start": 298.62, "text": "那好,我们复习一下刚刚学到的新单词。", "end": 302.74}, {"start": 302.74, "text": "就像Eric说的。", "end": 303.94}, {"start": 303.94, "text": "This,它不在那里,它在这里。", "end": 307.22}, {"start": 307.22, "text": "This is a hat,注意hat拼写。", "end": 318.9}, {"start": 318.9, "text": "This is a table, table怎么拼?", "end": 330.48}, {"start": 330.48, "text": "注意拼写,我们用发音去实际就好了。", "end": 333.68}, {"start": 333.68, "text": "T is t, a, t, a, t, a, b, b。", "end": 340.1}, {"start": 340.1, "text": "是b, t, a, b, table。", "end": 344.13}, {"start": 344.13, "text": "最后一个l的声音,l, e, t, a, b, table。", "end": 355.05}, {"start": 355.05, "text": "明白了吗?", "end": 356.13}, {"start": 356.13, "text": "所以为什么我说音标不重要。", "end": 358.45}, {"start": 358.45, "text": "关键是会发26个英语字母的音。", "end": 362.05}, {"start": 362.05, "text": "这里就是一次实践,不会拼这个词的。", "end": 365.65}, {"start": 365.65, "text": "这里注意。", "end": 366.65}, {"start": 366.65, "text": "This is a table, hat, table。", "end": 372.7}, {"start": 372.7, "text": "So what is this?", "end": 376.88}, {"start": 376.88, "text": "注意它在我这里,所以我说this。", "end": 380.21}, {"start": 380.21, "text": "What is this?", "end": 383.06}, {"start": 383.06, "text": "This is a hand怎么拼?", "end": 388.46}, {"start": 388.46, "text": "h, a, h, n, d, h, a, n, d。", "end": 395.79}, {"start": 395.79, "text": "所以自然是什么?", "end": 397.39}, {"start": 397.39, "text": "h, a, n, d。", "end": 401.19}, {"start": 401.19, "text": "你拼对了吗?", "end": 402.95}, {"start": 402.95, "text": "This is a hand。", "end": 407.34}, {"start": 407.34, "text": "那这一部分叫什么呢?", "end": 409.14}, {"start": 409.14, "text": "This part of the hand。", "end": 411.9}, {"start": 411.9, "text": "This is the um, th, a。", "end": 420.28}, {"start": 420.28, "text": "五个原因,a是u。", "end": 422.68}, {"start": 422.68, "text": "The um, m, b。", "end": 427.28}, {"start": 427.28, "text": "所以th, um, b。", "end": 431.1}, {"start": 431.1, "text": "This is the thumb。", "end": 433.42}, {"start": 433.42, "text": "a, m, b。", "end": 436.06}, {"start": 436.06, "text": "我建议大家在学拼写的时候,不论是孩子还是自己,", "end": 440.46}, {"start": 440.46, "text": "还是后续你经常拼错词,回归到读音去修正自己。", "end": 445.46}, {"start": 445.46, "text": "一旦你能读对读准,拼写就变得很简单了。", "end": 450.06}, {"start": 450.06, "text": "So th, a, m, b。", "end": 452.46}, {"start": 452.46, "text": "26个字母的发音还是要会的。", "end": 455.26}, {"start": 455.26, "text": "这不叫音标,这叫字母。", "end": 457.46}, {"start": 457.46, "text": "This is the thumb。", "end": 459.06}, {"start": 459.06, "text": "如果在你们手上,我就会说that is a thumb。", "end": 464.19}, {"start": 464.19, "text": "对吧?", "end": 467.86}, {"start": 467.86, "text": "好啦,万一有好几个呢?", "end": 470.46}, {"start": 470.46, "text": "我们现在讨论这四个fingers,right?", "end": 474.66}, {"start": 474.66, "text": "我们还能说this is for fingers。", "end": 477.46}, {"start": 477.46, "text": "很多人会犯这个错,right?", "end": 479.66}, {"start": 479.66, "text": "这个时候用了好几个,我们要改成刚学的these。", "end": 484.86}, {"start": 484.86, "text": "These are fingers。", "end": 488.34}, {"start": 488.34, "text": "我不能说this。", "end": 489.74}, {"start": 489.74, "text": "This is a thumb。", "end": 491.54}, {"start": 491.54, "text": "These are fingers。", "end": 493.54}, {"start": 493.54, "text": "好,那fingers怎么拼?", "end": 495.94}, {"start": 495.94, "text": "f-i-n-g-e-r,注意。", "end": 498.74}, {"start": 498.74, "text": "因为有好几个,英语在后面会加一个s的声音。", "end": 504.14}, {"start": 504.14, "text": "所以是fingers。", "end": 507.46}, {"start": 507.46, "text": "大家可以核对一下,自己是不是拼对了。", "end": 510.86}, {"start": 510.86, "text": "These are the fingers。", "end": 515.39}, {"start": 515.39, "text": "这叫自然的吸收一些单词。", "end": 517.79}, {"start": 517.79, "text": "不要去背,也不要去挤,感触一下就好啦。", "end": 522.09}, {"start": 522.09, "text": "好,那到这里为止,我们捡了几个新的单词。", "end": 525.89}, {"start": 525.89, "text": "我们再深化一下我们对指认失误的练习。", "end": 530.29}, {"start": 530.29, "text": "他正在指着这个女生说。", "end": 532.69}, {"start": 532.69, "text": "This is here。", "end": 536.18}, {"start": 536.18, "text": "This什么is here。", "end": 538.98}, {"start": 538.98, "text": "This man还是this woman。", "end": 543.23}, {"start": 543.23, "text": "其实把我说的也不确定了。", "end": 545.82}, {"start": 545.82, "text": "你们觉得这是一个男人还是女人?", "end": 547.82}, {"start": 547.82, "text": "肩膀这么正。", "end": 549.02}, {"start": 549.02, "text": "我们假设是个man好了。", "end": 552.06}, {"start": 552.06, "text": "This man is here。", "end": 554.06}, {"start": 554.49, "text": "This woman is here。", "end": 556.69}, {"start": 556.69, "text": "这里强调了he。", "end": 558.29}, {"start": 558.29, "text": "he是男的还是女的?", "end": 559.69}, {"start": 559.69, "text": "回忆一下。", "end": 561.09}, {"start": 561.09, "text": "he, she。", "end": 563.97}, {"start": 563.97, "text": "这里说什么?", "end": 564.97}, {"start": 564.97, "text": "he is there。", "end": 567.67}, {"start": 567.67, "text": "那说明这是一个男人。", "end": 569.07}, {"start": 569.07, "text": "所以什么?", "end": 569.87}, {"start": 569.87, "text": "This man is here。", "end": 573.43}, {"start": 573.43, "text": "He is here。", "end": 574.43}, {"start": 574.43, "text": "This man is here。", "end": 579.83}, {"start": 579.83, "text": "He is here。", "end": 581.83}, {"start": 581.83, "text": "This man is here。", "end": 583.86}, {"start": 583.86, "text": "He is here。", "end": 585.93}, {"start": 585.93, "text": "我既可以直接说this man,这个男人。", "end": 589.49}, {"start": 589.49, "text": "也可以说他,对吧。", "end": 591.89}, {"start": 591.89, "text": "这里都能指代这个男性。", "end": 594.09}, {"start": 594.09, "text": "你是明确说出这个男人。", "end": 596.89}, {"start": 596.89, "text": "还是代称he。", "end": 599.69}, {"start": 599.69, "text": "就由您自己决定了。", "end": 601.49}, {"start": 601.49, "text": "也要看情境的要求。", "end": 603.09}, {"start": 603.09, "text": "那相应的。", "end": 604.09}, {"start": 604.09, "text": "如果是一个女士站在那里。", "end": 605.89}, {"start": 605.89, "text": "我们一起练习一下。", "end": 608.09}, {"start": 608.09, "text": "我们在这里。", "end": 609.29}, {"start": 609.29, "text": "我们是这个态度。", "end": 611.65}, {"start": 611.65, "text": "That woman。", "end": 614.65}, {"start": 614.65, "text": "注意这里不是this woman。", "end": 616.45}, {"start": 616.45, "text": "是that woman。", "end": 617.85}, {"start": 617.85, "text": "That woman is here。", "end": 620.45}, {"start": 620.45, "text": "还是there。", "end": 621.85}, {"start": 621.85, "text": "That woman is there。", "end": 626.74}, {"start": 626.74, "text": "那里。", "end": 627.54}, {"start": 627.54, "text": "There is there。", "end": 630.22}, {"start": 630.22, "text": "只能填一个词怎么办呢?", "end": 632.96}, {"start": 632.96, "text": "你就不能说that woman了。", "end": 634.76}, {"start": 634.76, "text": "你只能说he还是she。", "end": 637.79}, {"start": 637.79, "text": "She is there。", "end": 640.55}, {"start": 640.55, "text": "非常好。", "end": 642.25}, {"start": 642.25, "text": "很多人上道了。", "end": 644.44}, {"start": 644.44, "text": "这就是梳理基本英语的最好方式。", "end": 648.84}, {"start": 648.84, "text": "走一遍。", "end": 650.04}, {"start": 650.04, "text": "That woman is there。", "end": 651.64}, {"start": 651.64, "text": "She is there。", "end": 653.04}, {"start": 653.04, "text": "是不是等同的?", "end": 654.64}, {"start": 654.64, "text": "That woman等于she。", "end": 656.64}, {"start": 656.84, "text": "That woman is there。", "end": 657.84}, {"start": 657.84, "text": "She is there。", "end": 658.64}, {"start": 658.64, "text": "注意拼写。", "end": 659.84}, {"start": 659.84, "text": "顺便了解一下她的拼写。", "end": 661.44}, {"start": 661.44, "text": "你会发现拼写跟发音一般来说是对得上。", "end": 665.64}, {"start": 665.64, "text": "90%的情况是对得上。", "end": 667.84}, {"start": 667.84, "text": "有时候对不上。", "end": 669.24}, {"start": 669.24, "text": "你再去自我修正一轮就好了。", "end": 671.64}, {"start": 671.64, "text": "英语毕竟有它漫长的历史。", "end": 673.84}, {"start": 673.84, "text": "有的发音随着时代变了。", "end": 676.04}, {"start": 676.04, "text": "但是拼写往往体现的是原始的发音。", "end": 680.07}, {"start": 680.07, "text": "So something to think about。", "end": 682.27}, {"start": 682.27, "text": "好。", "end": 683.89}, {"start": 683.89, "text": "我们现在进入一个实战。", "end": 685.69}, {"start": 685.69, "text": "注意考试无非也就是把情境转成文字。", "end": 689.29}, {"start": 689.29, "text": "所以当你的实战能力强的时候。", "end": 691.49}, {"start": 691.49, "text": "你就不会专门把考试当做一个训练目的。", "end": 695.09}, {"start": 695.09, "text": "Here.", "end": 696.99}, {"start": 696.99, "text": "This。", "end": 698.19}, {"start": 698.19, "text": "这个。", "end": 698.99}, {"start": 698.99, "text": "这个手离我们很近。", "end": 700.59}, {"start": 700.59, "text": "This something is holding a pen。", "end": 706.26}, {"start": 706.26, "text": "她在干嘛?", "end": 707.46}, {"start": 707.46, "text": "Holding a pen.", "end": 709.66}, {"start": 709.66, "text": "That's a pen.", "end": 710.86}, {"start": 710.86, "text": "The hand is holding a pen.", "end": 713.82}, {"start": 713.82, "text": "所以什么?", "end": 715.11}, {"start": 715.11, "text": "This.", "end": 716.11}, {"start": 719.05, "text": "怎么拼?", "end": 720.85}, {"start": 720.85, "text": "Hand.", "end": 722.45}, {"start": 722.45, "text": "This hand is holding a pen.", "end": 725.05}, {"start": 725.05, "text": "这种拼写学习方法也很适合幼儿。", "end": 728.25}, {"start": 728.25, "text": "是真正意义上的自然拼写。", "end": 731.05}, {"start": 731.05, "text": "随着你拼多了你就懂了。", "end": 733.45}, {"start": 733.45, "text": "我小时候也是这么学的。", "end": 735.25}, {"start": 735.25, "text": "我没有专门学音标。", "end": 736.65}, {"start": 736.65, "text": "更没有专门去学这个什么发音体系。", "end": 739.65}, {"start": 739.65, "text": "我就是拼着拼着会了。", "end": 741.45}, {"start": 741.45, "text": "很有意思吧?", "end": 742.25}, {"start": 742.25, "text": "This hand is holding a pen.", "end": 745.7}, {"start": 745.7, "text": "那个男人在那里。", "end": 748.5}, {"start": 748.5, "text": "所以什么man is reading a book?", "end": 751.9}, {"start": 751.9, "text": "所以book。", "end": 753.7}, {"start": 753.7, "text": "He is reading。", "end": 756.1}, {"start": 756.1, "text": "他正在看。", "end": 757.7}, {"start": 757.7, "text": "In.", "end": 758.7}, {"start": 758.7, "text": "Reading a book.", "end": 762.38}, {"start": 762.38, "text": "This man还是that man?", "end": 764.18}, {"start": 764.18, "text": "That man.", "end": 767.46}, {"start": 767.46, "text": "That man is reading a book.", "end": 769.26}, {"start": 769.26, "text": "看吧。", "end": 771.11}, {"start": 771.11, "text": "这句话就讲明白了。", "end": 773.31}, {"start": 773.31, "text": "That man is reading a book.", "end": 775.11}, {"start": 775.11, "text": "That man.", "end": 777.11}, {"start": 777.11, "text": "那个男人。", "end": 778.11}, {"start": 778.11, "text": "That man is reading a book.", "end": 780.91}, {"start": 780.91, "text": "Good。", "end": 781.71}, {"start": 781.71, "text": "好。", "end": 782.31}, {"start": 782.31, "text": "最后作为一个场景。", "end": 784.31}, {"start": 784.31, "text": "Practice makes perfect。", "end": 785.91}, {"start": 785.91, "text": "我们最后以场景模拟的方式去描述什么?", "end": 789.91}, {"start": 789.91, "text": "指认你桌面的物品并做简单的描述。", "end": 793.51}, {"start": 793.51, "text": "现在在你的附近肯定有一张桌子。", "end": 796.51}, {"start": 796.51, "text": "要么是你们客厅的餐桌。", "end": 798.51}, {"start": 798.51, "text": "要么是你自己的工作台桌。", "end": 801.51}, {"start": 801.51, "text": "不论是哪一种情况。", "end": 803.11}, {"start": 803.11, "text": "你可以简单的用这三句话去描述桌上的东西。", "end": 807.31}, {"start": 807.31, "text": "指认桌上的东西。", "end": 809.11}, {"start": 809.11, "text": "So first of all, this is。", "end": 811.71}, {"start": 811.71, "text": "看到This我们知道是什么。", "end": 813.31}, {"start": 813.31, "text": "这东西离我很近。", "end": 814.71}, {"start": 814.71, "text": "这个。", "end": 816.11}, {"start": 816.11, "text": "So你现在可能拿着手机。", "end": 818.31}, {"start": 818.31, "text": "This is。", "end": 819.31}, {"start": 819.31, "text": "This is a phone。", "end": 821.51}, {"start": 821.51, "text": "Phone。", "end": 823.31}, {"start": 823.31, "text": "This is a phone。", "end": 824.91}, {"start": 824.91, "text": "对吧。", "end": 825.51}, {"start": 825.51, "text": "It。", "end": 826.51}, {"start": 826.51, "text": "它是。", "end": 827.31}, {"start": 827.31, "text": "It。", "end": 828.31}, {"start": 828.31, "text": "我们一看到It就知道什么。", "end": 830.11}, {"start": 830.11, "text": "它不男不女。", "end": 831.11}, {"start": 831.11, "text": "它是一个物品。", "end": 833.11}, {"start": 833.11, "text": "It's a phone。", "end": 836.36}, {"start": 836.36, "text": "它不是男的也不是女的。", "end": 838.36}, {"start": 838.36, "text": "它是个物品。", "end": 839.56}, {"start": 839.56, "text": "It's a phone。", "end": 840.56}, {"start": 840.56, "text": "This is a phone。", "end": 843.17}, {"start": 843.17, "text": "这是一个手机。", "end": 845.38}, {"start": 845.38, "text": "它是一个手机。", "end": 846.78}, {"start": 846.78, "text": "It's a phone。", "end": 847.58}, {"start": 847.58, "text": "我也可以说。", "end": 848.38}, {"start": 848.38, "text": "It's a tool。", "end": 849.18}, {"start": 849.18, "text": "工具。", "end": 849.98}, {"start": 849.98, "text": "Right?", "end": 850.58}, {"start": 850.58, "text": "最后。", "end": 851.58}, {"start": 851.58, "text": "These are。", "end": 852.98}, {"start": 852.98, "text": "只有一个手机还能说These吗?", "end": 855.38}, {"start": 855.38, "text": "No。", "end": 856.38}, {"start": 856.38, "text": "那只能说This。", "end": 857.78}, {"start": 857.78, "text": "你桌上有什么东西有好几个的。", "end": 860.58}, {"start": 860.58, "text": "你现在就可以说了。", "end": 862.18}, {"start": 862.18, "text": "These are。", "end": 863.87}, {"start": 863.87, "text": "譬如有一张照片。", "end": 865.27}, {"start": 865.27, "text": "上面是全家福。", "end": 867.52}, {"start": 867.52, "text": "These are my children。", "end": 871.12}, {"start": 871.12, "text": "这是我的孩子们。", "end": 872.72}, {"start": 872.72, "text": "These are my children。", "end": 874.72}, {"start": 874.72, "text": "或者是你的父母。", "end": 876.32}, {"start": 876.32, "text": "These are my parents。", "end": 878.92}, {"start": 878.92, "text": "这些是我的父母。", "end": 881.12}, {"start": 881.12, "text": "Right?", "end": 881.52}, {"start": 881.52, "text": "我们跟别人介绍。", "end": 882.92}, {"start": 882.92, "text": "These are my parents。", "end": 884.52}, {"start": 884.52, "text": "These are。", "end": 885.12}, {"start": 885.12, "text": "I'm sorry。", "end": 885.92}, {"start": 885.92, "text": "These are my children。", "end": 887.72}, {"start": 887.72, "text": "These are my parents。", "end": 889.12}, {"start": 889.12, "text": "那有人就说了。", "end": 890.12}, {"start": 890.12, "text": "如果他们站很远怎么办?", "end": 892.32}, {"start": 892.32, "text": "Those。", "end": 893.32}, {"start": 893.32, "text": "这个我们后续会接触。", "end": 894.92}, {"start": 894.92, "text": "不要急。", "end": 896.34}, {"start": 896.34, "text": "这些简单的过一遍。", "end": 897.94}, {"start": 897.94, "text": "你当然也可以练习什么。", "end": 899.94}, {"start": 899.94, "text": "That。", "end": 901.14}, {"start": 901.14, "text": "如果你桌子很大或者离你很远。", "end": 903.94}, {"start": 903.94, "text": "或者别的桌子上有东西。", "end": 905.74}, {"start": 905.74, "text": "你就可以说。", "end": 906.74}, {"start": 906.74, "text": "That is a phone。", "end": 907.94}, {"start": 907.94, "text": "那是个手机。", "end": 909.74}, {"start": 909.74, "text": "Right?", "end": 910.14}, {"start": 910.14, "text": "截止到这里。", "end": 911.54}, {"start": 911.54, "text": "指任事务这节课就结束了。", "end": 914.54}, {"start": 914.54, "text": "第二节的另一节。", "end": 915.94}, {"start": 915.94, "text": "我们会马上进入。", "end": 917.34}]}